ied on  on the walkabout and then  he waited and took her with him and they  saw those flowers and one of the most  striking images that will stay with me  from today appears was of the two of  them walking through the gates of  buckingham yeah it was so powerful  wasn't it to face their future yeah in  their new home incredibly powerful yeah  in their new home uh sarah thank you  very much for that it was it was great  to watch it must have been great to be  down there i appreciate you giving us  that update
 

